{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "624946b2c54f4b7274d52b085cc1d7939e26c82acab123e801f89159769dae55", "ja": "未来の風", "zh": "未来之风", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd6571544a28400145b0b0109821285c429fa7f611eab0b60c62f6a630734234", "ja": "歌もダンスも仕上がった5人は、自分達の\nかけ声を作ることに。それぞれのアイディア\nを繋げてできたのは「未来の風は、いつだっ\nて、私達に向かって吹いている！」。向かい\n風を受けて、5人はより高く舞い上がる！", "zh": "在歌舞方面都做好万全准备的五人，\n决定要设计属于自己的加油口号。\n结合各自的点子之后完成的口号是\n「未来之风无论何时，都是向着我们吹来！」\n在逆风之中，五人将飞得更高更远！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "37443ac7f156ea6a85304971b5714501ad8a5493623d05da8812f97948a6f2c6", "ja": "（乙女ストーム！の公演まで、もうすぐ……。\nみんな、やる気は充分だ！）", "zh": "（『少女风暴！』的公演即将到来……\n大家都干劲十足！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "96ca4343fff7da6a64739cec7028c90788644eb548fc95f4d9494c6f748fb95e", "ja": "今日が、最後の全体レッスンです。レッスン前に、\n何か皆さんに話しておくことはありますか、リーダー。", "zh": "今天就是最后的团体课程。在开始之前，\n队长，你有话要和大家说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "4f92a4c7f91d804d4cdd18f9624fa07b504a542e29c11f5d1bb43823041d7c2a", "ja": "えっ、言いたいこと？　えっと、えっと……。\n最後だし、楽しくレッスン頑張ろうね、みんな♪", "zh": "咦，想说的话？呃，我想想……\n都到最后了，大家一起开开心心努力训练吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "94fbc95da6413887c2f066e3189dcabad7624f381c09cf7da19d8644e4d50164", "ja": "ふふっ、未来らしいね。\n……うん、楽しく頑張ろう！", "zh": "呵呵，真有未来的风格。\n……嗯，开开心心地加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7fe53451caa4981f190b09ca98ed581aa04c4cbf040a54dce0021f4abc0ccbd5", "ja": "そろそろ時間だな。\nみんな、お疲れ。レッスンはここまでだ。", "zh": "时间也差不多了。\n各位辛苦了，训练课程就到这里为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "405450716103883febff67c8a82c58484f2edaaf8433f759808ca1584d10fb4d", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}さん！　わたし達、\n歌もダンスもすっごくいい感じじゃなかった？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}先生！\n我们的歌声和舞蹈感觉都超棒的，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "0842a595d11070560c67d48054d23ae9a85c0225453fca9b769772c1cc11e7b0", "ja": "私も、そう思います。これなら間違いなく、\nいい公演になります。……巻き起こせ、乙女ストーム！", "zh": "我也这么认为，这样肯定会\n成为一场精彩的公演……掀起吧，『少女风暴！』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "3883528ea7d876261c348a554a4c1e0c0f196581fc4ae6f15ed7e4f40937a852", "ja": "うんうん♪\n最高のステージにできそう！　早くライブしたい！", "zh": "嗯嗯♪\n看来能完成最棒的表演呢！真想赶快开演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "07d0a28daf5dc6518642fcd627c8d17bd2b1d6b797a799394769d1924c01d745", "ja": "わたしも～♪　……あ、そうだ。\n最後にみんなで、円陣組もうよ！", "zh": "我也是～♪\n……啊，对了。最后大家一起来围圈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "0c985c28bd14b4c803bbd1e5f1031e7389fb7fbb75f6f3d45cd76ae86acd921e", "ja": "わぁ、気合い入りそう！\nそれじゃみんな、真ん中に集まって……。", "zh": "哇，感觉会很振奋心情！\n那大家聚集到中间来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "c8be5cc0df5424147249d1931d606231936df680dcca927e5119ceb448768c0c", "ja": "少し待ってください。\n円陣を組むなら、かけ声はどうしましょうか。", "zh": "请等一下。\n要围圈的话，加油口号要怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "44c9489ff0d3efa3b59b01d2fa7a328febd94f0943286d6170c641f65dfa394e", "ja": "あ、そっか。かけ声大事だよね……うーん……。\nでもかけ声って、なんて言えばいいんだろ？", "zh": "啊，对喔，加油口号很重要呢……嗯……\n但是加油口号要说什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "5eee890c7895e4e12e673754e016c32b6dc54da0b4c036b8f02428b5592ca085", "ja": "では、こんな言葉を入れてみるのはどうでしょうか。\nカキカキ……。", "zh": "那么，加入这样的词句如何呢？\n（写写写）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fe303210ed98c863347a32ad29a926752cec36fb7ef0a4f4cbb7f532a7734d05", "ja": "あ、瑞希ちゃんいい感じ♪　けど、ちょっと難しい？\nどうせなら、もっとオシャレな感じで……。", "zh": "啊，瑞希那样感觉不错♪但可能有点难？\n既然这样，就用更流行一点的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "10b02e350009b8acaddae7e28ba334cacf367a937fbb1da5676a322a12e757b8", "ja": "（オシャレなかけ声ってどんなだ……まぁいいか。\nここまで来たんだ、5人に任せるか）", "zh": "（流行的加油口号是什么啊……算了。\n已经走到这一步了，就交给她们五个人吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "b077faf1c8898949ff3036df00cfb641ab7acfcdc3908e14a3eb8bbcc20b1687", "ja": "うーん、どれも捨て難いな～。\nみんなのアイディア、全部採用しちゃおっか♪", "zh": "嗯～都好难割舍喔～\n把大家的点子全部加在一起好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "e742656baaa5afa9dc745e5e788047e2fe16584149c8a061fde11986d72532f8", "ja": "ええっ！？　それだと、\nまとまりのないかけ声になっちゃうんじゃ……？", "zh": "咦咦！？这样的话，\n会不会变得杂乱无章……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "40da085d1a0348a530a3f96097911ce6d54eb94bf824eb44f4dffa02ef2c2a32", "ja": "大丈夫、大丈夫♪　私に任せて♪\nえーっと、百合子が考えたのを最初にして……。", "zh": "没问题、没问题♪交给我吧♪\n我想想，把百合子想的放在最前面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "23aca64f73ffef8558ca27320dedd6ccc328be6de35448139ba5288d62b7ff59", "ja": "これをこうして、あーして……。\n……よーし、できたー♪", "zh": "这边这样排，那样排……\n……好～完成了──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "2a870a7afe199e64eeedf2ccf73071a330d45af3dfbf4837657267e3365e34ce", "ja": "じゃあさっそく\n気合いを入れるために、いってみよー♪", "zh": "那为了振奋精神，\n我们赶紧试试看吧──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "dabefef4345fcc108bf260b2d8aac1c4cc8fc9443e8a817691b2d131e0379ae7", "ja": "未来の風は、いつだって、私達に向かって吹いている！\n乙女ストーム！いっくぞー♪", "zh": "未来之风无论何时，都是向着我们吹来！\n『少女风暴！』要上啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3015b3e8640ad296ef467170a86c7c3106456835856a35b100da18d000fbf92e", "ja": "（未来……それじゃあ向かい風だ！）", "zh": "（未来……那样是逆风啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f4b159760e2cca0a8084a782dc50026780084a09ebb57f9a8ee6e2c663286237", "ja": "あれ？　それじゃ、向かい風になっちゃわない？", "zh": "奇怪？那不就变成逆风了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "c84e87dd013a20919a077fe045d73b26109d88be074e0212d713337c5b9da728", "ja": "あっ……。全然……気付かなかった。\nそっか……、向かい風……だね……。", "zh": "啊……我完全……没注意到。\n这样啊……是逆风……呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "84682d2b1d7293cabf9f9b1392b775ad7a565f40c810b09b079fae8cc884ab87", "ja": "大丈夫です。向かい風で問題ありません。", "zh": "没事的，是逆风也没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "71c111d1c75378b144e339b07366a566d6520828035d19143c8bb9bfd9d707fe", "ja": "瑞希？", "zh": "瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "cf88998b2e64bfa5ff1b4d139e9eafe458f243ecbb2cf94371f1b9e0e655a4ff", "ja": "鳥は、向かい風に向かって飛ぶそうです。\n高く、遠く飛ぶには、向かい風の力が必要ですから。", "zh": "鸟类似乎会朝着逆风的方向飞，\n因为要飞得又高又远，需要逆风的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "30b3aedf860cf6e966ab51785606a4da805dd43a1245688322c73e303c62ceb0", "ja": "さすが瑞希さん、いいこと言いますね！　それに、\n向かい風でないとつまらないと思うんです！", "zh": "真不愧是瑞希，说得太好了！\n而且啊，如果不是逆风就太无聊了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "4bf2bbe6730329db288e745efa3756e5036483acb7e2f73961756c334911d664", "ja": "物語の主人公は、\n逆境に打ち勝つからこそ、カッコイイんですから！！", "zh": "故事的主角正是因为克服了逆境，\n才会这么帅气！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a53ae6e93650fd51a8148caaa3107bf30bebeb8c682fc07a5368e2402fe16354", "ja": "なるほどな……。もしかして未来、\nそこまで考えて、そのかけ声に……？", "zh": "原来如此啊……未来，该不会你是\n考虑到这些，才用了这样的口号……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "32c038ea61105bdec25a060d6dfc68e4521b4ca677b4d24bcbcb5a1868e92007", "ja": "私達が考えたかけ声に、\nそんな意味があったなんて、全然知りませんでした！", "zh": "原来，我们的加油口号有这个意思\n我完全不知道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "f657ef727193849483464b89dff310ab8b3b84c2ffc09636f1a28f339b7767ff", "ja": "でもでも、すっごくいいかけ声になって、\n良かったです♪", "zh": "但是但是，能想出这么棒的加油口号，\n真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "52d0253dbe980889c5d4a4f87fa8255e5d078d7162a46758727101198d679831", "ja": "みんなの、心……\nひとつになった気が……するよ……♪", "zh": "大家的心……\n感觉……合而为一了呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7d96cd77443078b56aeba6635221425c0522dfd3810e9a5ab0a5598856fb7aa9", "ja": "そうか。……何はともあれ、いいかけ声だな。\n本番、頑張れよ！", "zh": "是吗……总之，这是个很好的口号。\n正式演出要加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "f4c4a95beb3f5469d8b2867e8c5aed8feb9b28112f9a5d88e9a41e3439e07b34", "ja": "はいっ！！", "zh": "好！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0009_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0009_story_06_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f4c4a95beb3f5469d8b2867e8c5aed8feb9b28112f9a5d88e9a41e3439e07b34", "ja": "はいっ！！", "zh": "好！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
